{# Free daily "GEX Morning Card" — one email per trading morning.

   Data comes from three places, all derived numbers (see the license-
   safety footer for why we never redistribute raw NBBO):

     * ``recap``   — yesterday's session recap paragraph, pulled from
                     the scorecard artifact for the prior trading day.
     * ``levels``  — today's projected gamma flip / call wall / put wall
                     for each symbol we forecast (SPY / SPX / QQQ).
     * ``pattern`` — one playbook pattern likely to trigger today, pulled
                     from the flagship_setup blob on today's forecast row.

   Missing sections quietly degrade — a broken row on one symbol doesn't
   kill the whole email. See src/jobs/publish_beehiiv.py for the render
   contract.
#}
<div style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; color: #111; line-height: 1.55;">

  <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
    GEX Morning Card &middot; {{ headline_date }}
  </p>
  <h1 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 24px 0;">
    Today's dealer gamma map.
  </h1>

  {% if recap %}
  <h2 style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #333;">
    Yesterday's tape
  </h2>
  <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0;">{{ recap }}</p>
  {% endif %}

  {% if levels %}
  <h2 style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #333;">
    Today's key levels
  </h2>
  <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0 0 24px 0;">
    <thead>
      <tr style="text-align: left; font-size: 12px; color: #666; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
        <th style="padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;">Symbol</th>
        <th style="padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;">Gamma Flip</th>
        <th style="padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;">Call Wall</th>
        <th style="padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;">Put Wall</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for row in levels %}
      <tr style="font-size: 14px;">
        <td style="padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; font-weight: 600;">${{ row.symbol }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;">{{ row.gamma_flip }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;">{{ row.call_wall }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;">{{ row.put_wall }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% endif %}

  {% if pattern %}
  <h2 style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #333;">
    One pattern to watch
  </h2>
  <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0;"><strong>{{ pattern.name }}</strong> &middot; ${{ pattern.symbol }}</p>
  <p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0;">{{ pattern.rationale }}</p>
  {% endif %}

  <div style="border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5; padding-top: 16px; margin-top: 24px;">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
      Want the deep dive? The <strong>Sunday Playbook Review</strong> covers
      last week's signal accuracy, one pattern that fired end-to-end, and
      next week's macro-adjacent gamma landscape.
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
      <a href="{{ upgrade_url }}" style="background: #111; color: #fff; padding: 10px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 600;">Upgrade to weekly ($15/mo)</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #999; margin-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5; padding-top: 12px;">
    This newsletter uses derived analytics computed by ZeroGEX. We do not
    redistribute raw exchange quotes. Data sourced via TradeStation.
  </p>

</div>
